    kind: work_item  # e94b
    title: "smart-test --full collects only packages/* and never the repo-root tests/ — a green local 'full' run does not predict CI"  # e94b
    status: todo_hard  # e94b
    priority: 2  # e94b
    parent:  # e94b
    tags:  # e94b
    - tooling  # e94b
    - ci  # e94b
