  message: "CORROBORATED and slightly WORSENED by PR #948 (INV-sotam), dev 95041b0931.\n\nThat PR added a SECOND call site running the full suite, and it reuses the\nsame target this item is about:\n\n    run_pytest \"packages/*/tests/\" -n 2\n\nThere are now three sites with that target: run_full_suite(), the existing\n--full branch, and the new --full arm inside the docs/config-only branch. So\nfix (a) on this item -- make --full collect the repo-root tests/ -- now has\nto land in three places rather than two, and a fix applied to only one of\nthem would leave --full partial on exactly the path INV-sotam just opened.\n\nRecorded rather than fixed in that PR because (a) changes WHAT --full runs\nand interacts with the coverage scope: root tests are not necessarily under\nCOV_PATHS, so adding them could turn a green --full red for reasons that\nhave nothing to do with this defect. That needs its own measurement, which\nis this item.\n\nFix (b) on this item -- have --full PRINT what it collected and what it\nskipped -- is untouched and is still worth doing independently, for the\nreason already filed: the next divergence will not be this one."  # cfc2
